management program updated.
DTS will collect Cheyenne's roadway inventory with 1 or more Mobile Asset Collection (MAc) vehicles.
The collection routes will be calculated to minimize down times or areas of heavy congestion such as
during Frontier Days or other festivals.DTS will work with the City of Cheyenne to setupa pllot project
area so initial sample datacanbe collected and verified.DTS will collect data on the pilot project area
