DTS proposes collecting pilot data in multiple locations to capture both asphalt and concrete surfaces
for local roads.
Collection Method/Equipment
DTS collection vehicles are outfitted to collect colorright-of-way images synchronized to the MAC DM1,
IMU and GPS.The standard configuration of a MAC vehicle utilizes a 4-camera configuration:3 forward-
facingfora120-degree view andone rear-facing fora90-degree view.These cameras have a1936x1456
